{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14221080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14221080","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1422108001:0":{"text":"你最近执勤的时候时有没有放行从王城来到平民区的人？","source_cn":"你最近执勤的时候时有没有放行从王城来到平民区的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C80CC2FBC0EB08E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422108002:0":{"text":"报告大人！除了那些被驱赶出王城的仆从外，绝对没有放行任何可疑的人！……不对！除了一位贵族……","source_cn":"报告大人！除了那些被驱赶出王城的仆从外，绝对没有放行任...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7672B352F88D312","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422108003:0":{"text":"那个人穿着贵族服饰，说他是一位子爵，正在追赶家里的逃奴……我实在不敢阻拦……大人我错了！","source_cn":"那个人穿着贵族服饰，说他是一位子爵，正在追赶家里的逃奴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAE44B29ECC8A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422108004:0":{"text":"……知道了，继续执勤吧。","source_cn":"……知道了，继续执勤吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x012E3FC01E9EB82A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"因度厄","source":"因度厄","status":"source"},"speaker:大意的卫兵":{"text":"大意的卫兵","source":"大意的卫兵","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}